# Duration Field

## Summary
A composite FieldDef holding `value` (number) + `unit` (minutes | hours | days | weeks | months) with a computed humanized `label`. Edit is a number input + unit select; embedded is a clock pill; atom is compact (`45m`, `3d`, `2w`).

## Import
```ts
import { DurationField } from './duration-field';
```

## Usage
```ts
@field duration = contains(DurationField);
// computed example
@field tenure = contains(DurationField, {
  computeVia: function (this: Employee) {
    let days = daysBetween(this.startDate);
    return days == null ? undefined : new DurationField({ value: days, unit: 'days' });
  },
});
```

## Template Usage
```hbs
<@fields.duration />
<@fields.duration @format='atom' />
```

**Non-goals:** calendar-aware durations (business days, holidays). OPEN QUESTION for the author: `base/time/duration` already ships in base — consume it, or keep this value+unit editor as a deliberate divergence for people-ops durations (tenure, time-to-hire) and record why here.
